                <div class="location-info">
                    <h3>Getting to Our Office</h3>
                    <p><strong>Address:</strong> 62 Watt Ave, Welland L3B 1J3 ON</p>
                    
                    <h4>Parking</h4>
                    <p>Free parking is available in front of our building and in the adjacent parking lot.</p>
                    
                    <h4>Public Transportation</h4>
                    <p>Our office is accessible via Welland Transit routes 1, 2, and 3. The nearest bus stop is at the corner of Watt Ave and Niagara Street.</p>
                    
                    <h4>Accessibility</h4>
                    <p>Our office is wheelchair accessible with ramp access and automatic doors. Please let us know if you require any accommodations for your visit.</p>
                    
                    <div class="emergency-contact" style="margin-top: 30px; padding: 20px; background-color: var(--light); border-left: 4px solid var(--accent);">
                        <h4><i class="fas fa-exclamation-circle" style="color: var(--accent);"></i> Emergency Contact</h4>
                        <p>For urgent staffing needs outside business hours, please call our emergency line:</p>
                        <p style="font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--primary);">
                            <i class="fas fa-phone"></i> (647) 287-0676 (Press 1 for emergencies)
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Departments -->
    <section class="section-padding">
        <div class="container">
