                <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                <p>Common questions about contacting us</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="faq-grid">
                <div class="faq-item">
                    <h3>What's the fastest way to request staff?</h3>
                    <p>The quickest way is to use our <a href="forms.html">online forms</a> or call us directly at (647) 287-0676 during business hours.</p>
                </div>
                
                <div class="faq-item">
                    <h3>Do you offer 24/7 emergency staffing?</h3>
                    <p>Yes, we have an emergency line for urgent staffing needs outside regular business hours. Call (647) 287-0676 and press 1 for emergencies.</p>
                </div>
                
                <div class="faq-item">
                    <h3>How quickly can you fill staffing requests?</h3>
                    <p>For urgent requests, we can often provide staff within 24-48 hours. Standard requests are typically filled within 3-5 business days.</p>
                </div>
                
                <div class="faq-item">
                    <h3>Can I visit your office without an appointment?</h3>
                    <p>While walk-ins are welcome, we recommend calling ahead to schedule an appointment to ensure the right team member is available to assist you.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
